msgid ""
"Count only records that carry this activity in their Activity field.\n"
"\n"
"Tick this whenever several activities count the same kind of record. Two activities both counting timesheets would otherwise each measure *all* the hours, and every rule would get the same split — a mistake that produces plausible-looking numbers.\n"
"\n"
