#. module: gec_analytic_margin
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gec_analytic_margin.view_gec_activity_form
msgid ""
"Only the consumed share of the pool is charged out.\n"
"                                The cost of unused capacity stays on the source, so a\n"
